WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.209
In Blast, open People.

2
00:00:04.363 --> 00:00:06.275
Your book holds the people who

3
00:00:06.275 --> 00:00:08.475
gave your brand their details.

4
00:00:08.813 --> 00:00:10.592
It starts empty.

5
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.063
To add someone by hand, click Add.

6
00:00:14.997 --> 00:00:16.797
Type their name and email.

7
00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:18.368
For a phone number,

8
00:00:18.368 --> 00:00:20.159
pick the country first,

9
00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:21.921
then type the number.

10
00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.828
Click Add person,

11
00:00:23.828 --> 00:00:25.395
and they're in your book.

12
00:00:25.947 --> 00:00:28.013
To bring in a whole list,

13
00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:31.859
click Import and choose a CSV file.

14
00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.296
Mingla matches your columns for you:

15
00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:39.262
name, email and phone.

16
00:00:39.963 --> 00:00:42.392
Columns it doesn't need are ignored.

17
00:00:42.747 --> 00:00:45.472
The preview shows what will happen before

18
00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:48.417
anything is added: twelve people to add.

19
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.404
Confirm you have permission

20
00:00:50.404 --> 00:00:51.625
to contact them,

21
00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.263
then import.

22
00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:54.700
Twelve added.

23
00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:59.807
Your book now has thirteen contacts.

24
00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.901
Groups organise people

25
00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:03.753
for focused campaigns.

26
00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.199
Click Create group and name it: Regulars.

27
00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.639
Then select people from your book.

28
00:01:10.797 --> 00:01:12.571
Tick the six you want,

29
00:01:13.513 --> 00:01:15.052
and review the group.

30
00:01:15.163 --> 00:01:16.401
Six people.

31
00:01:16.613 --> 00:01:18.311
Nothing is sent now.

32
00:01:19.247 --> 00:01:22.423
Create the group, and Regulars is ready.

33
00:01:23.847 --> 00:01:27.021
To reach them, click Start campaign.

34
00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.992
Regulars is already the audience.

35
00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.210
Write it as an email or an SMS.

36
00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:37.030
Get Mingla Host at usemingla

37
00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.455
dot com slash host.

